      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "podcast-episode-template"
        },
        "visibilityRole": "editor",
        "markdown": "## Concrete episode checklist\\n\\nRequired: title, publication date, summary, parent work reference, and at least one real Experience target.\\n\\nOptional: ordered Segment nodes, episode-specific Media, Resource nodes for transcript and show notes, and Milestones only for meaningful changes.\\n\\nBranding rule: replace the neutral icon title and HTML with the parent show’s identity. The icon must not retain another show’s name, and portal sourceNodeId must target this episode’s actual icon surface.\\n\\nNever use sourceRef for a citation URL. Use referenceUri or a Resource node.\\n\\nEmbed rule: every instantiated episode must set the Episode Player embedRef to the same playable canonical URL used by the episode and its primary Experience node."
      }
    },
